TWO DISTRIBUTION CAVEATS

- PyAV (av): the pip wheels bundle GPLv3 FFmpeg. GPL does not cross a normal
  `import`, so listing av in requirements.txt (users pip-install it themselves)
  is fine. Do not vendor the wheel into a self-contained artifact (e.g. a Docker
  image) without accepting GPLv3 on that artifact.
- DINOv3: if you ever redistribute DINOv3-derived weights or code, the DINOv3
  License must travel with those files and cannot be relicensed under CC BY-NC.
  This repository does not redistribute DINOv3 weights (baselines are linked,
  not shipped), so no DINOv3 files are covered by this release.

